  "description": "An idiomatic, immutable, fluent C# wrapper over Kookerella.FsOpenXmlDsl - build and read Excel workbooks (.xlsx/.xlsm) from C# without touching F# discriminated unions or option types directly. Covers cell values, formulas, and basic styling (font/fill/border/alignment/number format); the full F# DSL (tables, charts, pivot tables, VBA, code generation, etc.) is available by referencing Kookerella.FsOpenXmlDsl directly.",
